        a number called 'the match' is 'rng below' of 5 add 1,
        a number called 'the replacement' is 'rng below' of 100,
        Set clauses to "{clauses} and each e{'the loop name'} from {'range start'} to {'range end'} treating {'the match'} as {'the replacement'}",
        Set 'the clause' to 'the clause' add 1.
