    a text called 'loop line' is "For each number from 1 to {'the limit'}, Print number, If number is equal to {'the guard'} then, Break. Print \"x\"".
    a list called 'the lines' is ['loop line'].
    'gen join lines' of indent and nested and 'the lines'.

