To 'gen loop' with a number called depth and a text called indent.
    a number called 'the spread' is 'rng below' of 5.
    a number called 'the iteration limit' is 'the spread' add 1.
    a text called head is "{indent}For each number from 1 to {'the iteration limit'},\n".
